{
  "_about": "Where the themes' interface sounds are looked for (docs/THEMES.md, Les sons). scripts/theme_sounds.py library downloads each source into tmp/sound-library/ and lists its sounds in the catalogue the sound bench plays. A source is an archive, checked against its sha256, whose audio folder is taken whole; or files, a list of sounds each downloaded from its url and checked against its own sha256, named by name, credited by its own page, and by its own author and licence where it has them. A sound's id is '<title> · <file name without extension>', the title its credit in a theme's sounds.json. family says how its sounds group on the bench: 'stem', the file name without its trailing number (click_004 → click); 'folder', the folder it lies in. Only CC0 1.0 and CC BY 4.0 are taken: free for F-Droid, CC BY asking only the credit sounds.json gives.",
